 and $2.87 per share. Kevin will provide more details on our…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2019 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2019-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"Our guidance for 2020 core FFO per share reflects a growth rate of 3.4% over the midpoint of our increased 2019 guidance, which is consistent with our goal of steady per share growth on a multi-year basis.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2019 Q4","e":"nnn","d":"2020-02-11","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"We've got good relationships with AMC and Cinemark and so you may well see us do occasional theaters with our relationship tenants from time to time, but it will be in situations where we feel like the price per property is a good number and the location is good as well as having a strong operator.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/11/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q1","e":"nnn","d":"2020-05-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"So in the restaurant sector, in the family entertainment and health and fitness and movie theaters, those are the sectors where the tenants needed -- definitely had their businesses significantly affected.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q1","e":"nnn","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Vikram Malhotra","x":"And then just on any tenants that may have announced bankruptcy or some sort of restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q1","e":"nnn","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Vikram Malhotra","x":"I know Chuck E. Cheese's, there was an article out that they may be in some sort of restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q1","e":"nnn","d":"2020-05-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"Based on the current uncertainty about the depth and duration of the economic turmoil that almost all companies are enduring at the moment, we have withdrawn our guidance for 2020 results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2020-08-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Kevin B. Habicht","x":"These receivables are concentrated in our four retail lines of trades where our collections have generally been hit the hardest, which we noted on last quarter's call, namely theaters, full service restaurants, health and fitness, and family entertainment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2020-08-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Kevin B. Habicht","x":"The lines of trade that have been -- that's struggling the most during the last few months has been the theaters and health and fitness.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/03/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2020-11-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Kevin B. Habicht","x":"I think we're -- we'll stick with our big -- the troubled four lines of trade really as where the pain continues to reside, I think, which has been theaters, health and fitness, casual dining and family entertainment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2020-11-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Kevin B. Habicht","x":"I will say going into this, we thought theaters would be the most troublesome and with the benefit of six months, I would say that still feels the case out of those four lines of trade.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/02/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q4","e":"nnn","d":"2021-02-11","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Stephen A. Horn Jr.","x":"Now as far as the number that we're throwing out there, the market is a little bit smaller for us, meaning movie theaters, there's really no market for them; family entertainment; and as far as health and fitness, a much smaller market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2020 Q4","e":"nnn","d":"2021-02-11","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Kevin B. Habicht","x":"So yes, you might think some of our others, some theaters, for example, might not be paying quite that level, 50%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q1","e":"nnn","d":"2021-05-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Stephen A. Horn Jr.","x":"The fitness arena and the movie theaters, the market isn't very robust.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q1","e":"nnn","d":"2021-05-04","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Stephen A. Horn Jr.","x":"It's primarily movie theaters make up the first quarter, and that was kind of what we stated at the beginning because we hadn't reached agreement, discussions were going on in 2020, and we finally got it documented in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Parker Decraene","x":"Jay, I just -- I noticed that you guys bought a theater asset during the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q2-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"We did not buy that theater.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q2-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2021-08-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"And so AMC took over that theater as part of a restructuring, a workout with the other tenant that was struggling.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/03/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q2-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"The movie theater industry is one where we are still remaining very cautious.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"theater","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"AMC is our primary tenant in the movie theater sector.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen A. Horn Jr.","x":"But they're starting to be able to pass through the top line to the consumer slowly to combat the wage inflation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2021 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2021-11-02","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Julian E. Whitehurst","x":"And as our press release this morning indicates, we are again raising our guidance for 2021 core FFO per share to a range of $2.80 to $2.84 per share, which reflects an approximate 9% increase over 2020 performance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/02/national-retail-properties-inc-nnn-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"NNN 2025 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2025-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Steve Horn","x":"I think there is better visibility on the tariffs in the conversations that we have with our tenants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nnn-reit-nnn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NNN 2025 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2025-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vincent Chao","x":"…is pretty robust right now, and, you know, I cannot say with certainty that is because of tariffs, but to the extent that it costs a lot more to buy a new car, you know, we should, you know, I think it is logical to assume that is gonna help our auto services business on the repair side…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nnn-reit-nnn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NNN 2025 Q2","e":"nnn","d":"2025-08-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Horn","x":"We feel positive about the long-term prospects for these assets as the company works through the restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/nnn-reit-nnn-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NNN 2025 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2025-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Spencer Glimcher","x":"So do you think that the alternative capital sources are kind of swinging the pricing power pendulum more to tenants than we have seen historically?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/nnn-reit-nnn-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"NNN 2025 Q3","e":"nnn","d":"2025-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Steve Horn","x":"More importantly, NNN had 100% of its leases affirmed during the restructuring given the strong property-level performance and low in-place rent.","ur